WEBVTT

00:01:55.100 --> 00:01:58.680
<i>Kou-chan? Something came up on that Z.</i>

00:01:59.230 --> 00:02:03.640
<i>This Asakura guy was apparently quite
famous on Wangan until two years ago.</i>

00:02:03.640 --> 00:02:05.230
Two years ago?

00:02:05.230 --> 00:02:07.010
So, did he quit?

00:02:07.010 --> 00:02:07.930
<i>Ah, no...</i>

00:02:07.930 --> 00:02:09.130
<i>He's dead.</i>

00:02:09.130 --> 00:02:11.280
D–Dead?!

00:02:12.480 --> 00:02:14.550
<i>Died at dawn on Wangan.</i>

00:02:36.140 --> 00:02:37.550
There's no way I'll lose

00:02:38.230 --> 00:02:39.540
as long as I have this Z!

00:02:52.650 --> 00:02:55.150
I'm leading. I can do this!

00:03:20.210 --> 00:03:23.210
<i>Kou-chan, you know the BlackBird, right?</i>

00:03:26.230 --> 00:03:30.400
<i>That was the guy he was racing when he had the accident.</i>

00:03:35.230 --> 00:03:36.730
<i>Asakura!</i>

00:03:49.220 --> 00:03:51.990
<i>The Z was only lightly damaged, so it was repaired,</i>

00:03:51.990 --> 00:03:56.210
<i>and each time its owner changed,
it got into new accidents.</i>

00:04:08.390 --> 00:04:13.510
Why didn't it move the way I wanted it to?

00:04:21.100 --> 00:04:21.170
<i>The BlackBird</i>

00:04:21.170 --> 00:04:25.230
<i>Takahashi Auto</i>
<i>The BlackBird</i>

00:04:25.230 --> 00:04:25.950
I'm sorry, Akio, but this Z is a goner.

00:04:25.950 --> 00:04:26.180
<i>Takahashi Auto</i>

00:04:26.180 --> 00:04:29.650
I'm sorry, Akio, but this Z is a goner.

00:04:29.650 --> 00:04:31.270
It can't be... Kou-chan.

00:04:31.270 --> 00:04:33.470
It's like I just said.

00:04:35.050 --> 00:04:36.780
This really is the Devil Z.

00:04:36.780 --> 00:04:40.520
If you really want an S30Z so badly, find another one.

00:04:40.520 --> 00:04:41.920
Just forget about this one.

00:04:41.920 --> 00:04:43.000
But...

00:04:46.250 --> 00:04:47.650
Hey, Akio.

00:04:47.650 --> 00:04:49.690
Cars are for having fun with, not getting killed with.

00:04:49.690 --> 00:04:50.990
Kou-chan...

00:04:51.600 --> 00:04:54.480
Let's give up on this one, ok?

00:05:09.850 --> 00:05:11.850
It's been a month.

00:05:11.850 --> 00:05:14.790
The Devil Z has completely vanished.

00:05:15.630 --> 00:05:21.200
Of course, after an accident like that, it takes
time for both the car and the driver to recover.

00:05:21.910 --> 00:05:23.690
It's only natural that he's not around,

00:05:23.690 --> 00:05:26.790
yet without even thinking about it,
I find myself searching for him.

00:05:31.700 --> 00:05:33.410
It's just up ahead from here, Eriko.

00:05:34.620 --> 00:05:37.850
The place where the guy who drove a
Z just like your dead brother's crashed.

00:05:38.680 --> 00:05:40.990
I didn't stop for him.

00:05:40.990 --> 00:05:43.050
After your brother died two years ago,

00:05:43.050 --> 00:05:44.770
no matter who has an accident,

00:05:44.770 --> 00:05:46.260
I won't stop anymore.

00:05:51.860 --> 00:05:53.110
<i>See ya, Eriko.</i>

00:05:53.110 --> 00:05:55.790
<i>Wait up, Akio!</i>

00:05:55.790 --> 00:05:57.240
<i>Did you find your keys?</i>

00:05:58.730 --> 00:06:00.470
<i>I couldn't find them.</i>

00:06:00.470 --> 00:06:01.540
<i>I'll just use the spare.</i>

00:06:01.540 --> 00:06:04.150
<i>But you said that key is good luck!</i>

00:06:05.910 --> 00:06:08.330
<i>I'm not gonna get in an accident just
because I used the spare key.</i>

00:06:08.330 --> 00:06:10.260
<i>You're too quick to worry.</i>

00:06:12.650 --> 00:06:14.010
<i>I'll tell Tatsuya</i>

00:06:14.010 --> 00:06:16.300
<i>that he shouldn't spend all his time with cars</i>

00:06:16.300 --> 00:06:18.560
<i>when he's got such a cute girl in front of him.</i>

00:06:37.110 --> 00:06:38.830
We're close now...

00:06:40.230 --> 00:06:41.830
to the scene of the crash.

00:07:04.250 --> 00:07:05.860
Thank you.

00:07:06.890 --> 00:07:08.100
Welcome...

00:07:10.120 --> 00:07:11.610
<i>The BlackBird...</i>

00:07:17.110 --> 00:07:18.620
<i>It's definitely him.</i>

00:07:20.370 --> 00:07:23.620
Oh, looks like you didn't hurt yourself too badly.

00:07:23.620 --> 00:07:25.640
Eriko, this is him,

00:07:25.640 --> 00:07:27.290
the driver of that Z.

00:07:29.000 --> 00:07:30.420
You?

00:07:30.420 --> 00:07:31.400
Hello.

00:07:37.890 --> 00:07:39.610
So, you drive the BlackBird?

00:07:39.610 --> 00:07:41.720
Yeah. My name is Shima Tatsuya.

00:07:41.720 --> 00:07:42.920
You?

00:07:42.920 --> 00:07:45.510
I'm Asakura. Asakura Akio.

00:07:45.510 --> 00:07:46.410
No way!

00:07:47.670 --> 00:07:49.820
No joke. It's true.

00:07:49.820 --> 00:07:51.940
I've got the same name by coincidence.

00:07:52.340 --> 00:07:54.980
I guess it's some weird twist of fate, huh?

00:07:54.980 --> 00:07:56.940
What happened to that Z?

00:07:58.100 --> 00:08:00.200
It'll eventually come back.

00:08:01.650 --> 00:08:03.150
To the Wangan highway, that is.

00:08:23.990 --> 00:08:26.030
Looks like it's all better.

00:08:31.210 --> 00:08:33.690
Looks like your wound's healed, Akio.

00:08:33.690 --> 00:08:34.660
Yup.

00:08:34.660 --> 00:08:38.980
You said you had a car accident, but I bet
you got in a fight with a girl, didn't you?

00:08:38.980 --> 00:08:40.210
Nah.

00:08:40.210 --> 00:08:41.200
Akio!

00:08:41.710 --> 00:08:43.530
There's a call for you.

00:08:43.530 --> 00:08:44.470
Ok.

00:08:44.470 --> 00:08:46.970
Speak of the devil.

00:08:47.550 --> 00:08:49.390
Asakura speaking.

00:08:49.390 --> 00:08:51.500
<i>I'm Tamura from the auto parts shop.</i>

00:08:51.500 --> 00:08:54.590
<i>The parts you ordered have arrived.</i>

00:08:54.590 --> 00:08:56.570
So, we'll meet up at the usual place?

00:08:56.570 --> 00:08:58.200
<i>Do you want to pay then and there?</i>

00:08:58.200 --> 00:09:00.720
Yeah, I have the money ready.

00:09:00.720 --> 00:09:02.590
See you then. Thank you.

00:09:03.420 --> 00:09:04.480
Hey.

00:09:04.480 --> 00:09:07.480
You shouldn't hang out with girls
that cost that much money.

00:09:07.480 --> 00:09:12.010
Especially since he failed to graduate from high school
and was forced to repeat. All because of women, too.

00:09:13.080 --> 00:09:14.450
You've got it all wrong.

00:09:14.450 --> 00:09:16.270
I skipped school so I could work.

00:09:16.270 --> 00:09:17.500
Work?

00:09:17.500 --> 00:09:20.220
Is that so? Don't you mean "for the women"?

00:09:20.920 --> 00:09:23.270
Well, she is quite the "lady."

00:09:24.020 --> 00:09:26.190
Ladies, huh? You old dog!

00:09:27.990 --> 00:09:29.050
Ready to go?

00:09:29.050 --> 00:09:29.950
Yeah.

00:09:29.950 --> 00:09:31.920
Ok. I'll escort you.

00:09:31.920 --> 00:09:33.550
Oh, you don't have to.

00:09:33.550 --> 00:09:36.040
I'll sleep over with a friend who lives nearby.

00:09:36.580 --> 00:09:37.370
I see.

00:09:37.370 --> 00:09:38.840
Thank you.

00:09:43.650 --> 00:09:44.800
See ya, Akio!

00:09:44.800 --> 00:09:46.660
Say hello to your lady for me.

00:09:46.660 --> 00:09:49.300
Will do. Bye.

00:09:52.700 --> 00:09:55.730
An expensive lady, huh...

00:10:01.220 --> 00:10:05.980
The people at that gas station told
me that you work here at night.

00:10:12.440 --> 00:10:15.910
It's late. You have something to say to me?

00:10:22.190 --> 00:10:24.300
Always quiet, huh?

00:10:26.300 --> 00:10:28.580
Not that I mind.

00:10:36.600 --> 00:10:38.610
You walked all the way here.

00:10:49.610 --> 00:10:52.340
I've got some things to do now.

00:10:52.340 --> 00:10:53.860
Please try to stay out of the way.

00:11:06.210 --> 00:11:08.650
This can't be <i>that</i> entertaining.

00:11:23.270 --> 00:11:25.320
You've let your hair grow out.

00:11:26.660 --> 00:11:27.800
Three years ago,

00:11:27.800 --> 00:11:30.240
I remember seeing you for a few
seconds on Yamashita Street.

00:11:30.240 --> 00:11:32.080
You were riding in this Z, right?

00:11:33.860 --> 00:11:35.210
My brother...

00:11:36.230 --> 00:11:37.860
He died

00:11:37.860 --> 00:11:39.040
while driving this Z.

00:11:42.070 --> 00:11:43.920
You're the same as him.

00:11:43.920 --> 00:11:45.650
Working a number of jobs

00:11:45.650 --> 00:11:47.050
and tampering with the car all night.

00:11:47.690 --> 00:11:50.200
Everyone around him kept telling him how dangerous that Z was.

00:11:50.200 --> 00:11:53.600
It was like it was possessed by the devil himself.

00:11:57.330 --> 00:11:58.610
Tell me something.

00:12:01.610 --> 00:12:06.030
My brother was the same.
Why does it have to be this car?

00:12:08.110 --> 00:12:10.570
Why can't it be a car other than this Z?

00:12:11.010 --> 00:12:12.570
How should I know?

00:12:13.570 --> 00:12:17.580
Even though my name's the same,
I'm not your brother.

00:12:18.100 --> 00:12:22.390
Besides, the past is the past. This Z is now mine.

00:12:28.100 --> 00:12:31.400
Even if it's a demon, I like it.

00:12:35.100 --> 00:12:36.150
Go back

00:12:36.150 --> 00:12:38.170
and tell this to the BlackBird.

00:12:38.170 --> 00:12:44.150
Next week, Wednesday, 3am. I'll be waiting
for him at the Wangan Ichikawa Parking Area.

00:12:45.400 --> 00:12:46.720
I...

00:12:46.720 --> 00:12:49.150
I just don't want anyone else to die!

00:13:17.760 --> 00:13:19.320
Oil pressure ok.

00:13:19.320 --> 00:13:20.820
Temperature ok.

00:13:20.820 --> 00:13:22.200
Idle ok.

00:13:22.200 --> 00:13:23.510
All right.

00:13:25.120 --> 00:13:26.980
You're good to go, Z.

00:13:50.090 --> 00:13:56.060
Man, I can't believe you actually went
and repaired this thing yourself.

00:14:00.630 --> 00:14:03.520
Fine, I won't say another word about it.

00:14:03.520 --> 00:14:05.590
Thanks, Kou-chan.

00:14:05.590 --> 00:14:09.100
I noticed your driving style has changed, though.

00:14:09.100 --> 00:14:10.020
Changed?

00:14:10.020 --> 00:14:12.730
It's not just an improvement.

00:14:12.730 --> 00:14:15.710
Watching from behind, the whole style seems good overall.

00:14:15.710 --> 00:14:17.320
It's smooth.

00:14:17.320 --> 00:14:22.040
I guess you're getting better.
Seems like you're really connecting with the Z.

00:14:22.040 --> 00:14:23.160
Well,

00:14:23.160 --> 00:14:24.520
I don't know about that.

00:14:25.310 --> 00:14:26.840
What do you mean?

00:14:26.840 --> 00:14:30.630
If you lose concentration, even for a moment, it seems
like the Z will turn against you in a blink of an eye.

00:14:30.630 --> 00:14:31.980
That's what it's like.

00:14:44.130 --> 00:14:47.200
So, you're gonna race the BlackBird again on Wednesday?

00:14:47.950 --> 00:14:50.100
You'll get yourself killed this time.

00:14:50.100 --> 00:14:52.670
But I guess that kind of life is fine too.

00:14:53.690 --> 00:14:56.250
I really don't get you.

00:14:56.250 --> 00:15:00.200
I still think you should've stuck to the first Z you had.

00:15:00.200 --> 00:15:04.710
Besides, didn't you work your ass off back then to buy that Z?

00:15:04.710 --> 00:15:07.650
I borrowed half the money from my dad.

00:15:08.460 --> 00:15:10.650
And you sold it at almost half the price.

00:15:10.650 --> 00:15:13.270
Now you went and bought this junker of a Z.

00:15:13.270 --> 00:15:15.570
You're probably working all the time again, right?

00:15:15.570 --> 00:15:19.090
Damn right. If only I'd found this one first.

00:15:19.090 --> 00:15:21.260
That's not it.

00:15:21.260 --> 00:15:24.030
What matters is that I think this is good.

00:15:24.030 --> 00:15:29.020
Yeah, if you crash, it's you who dies. I'm not getting in that thing.

00:15:43.990 --> 00:15:45.080
What is it?

00:15:45.080 --> 00:15:46.470
Have you been waiting for me?

00:15:47.020 --> 00:15:49.630
It's difficult to go in, for some reason.

00:15:49.630 --> 00:15:51.580
Yeah, I guess you're right.

00:15:51.580 --> 00:15:52.510
Oh...

00:15:52.510 --> 00:15:54.420
I relayed your message to Shima-san.

00:15:55.050 --> 00:15:57.670
He said Wednesday is fine.

00:16:00.750 --> 00:16:02.570
Did you drop by just to tell me that?

00:16:03.410 --> 00:16:06.080
Um, ah... There's something else...

00:16:07.210 --> 00:16:10.670
Well, wait for me at the doughnut shop
at the entrance of Motomachi.

00:16:10.670 --> 00:16:12.600
I get off at twelve.

00:16:19.940 --> 00:16:21.250
Where do you live?

00:16:21.250 --> 00:16:23.090
Setagaya.

00:16:23.090 --> 00:16:24.690
Keihin Route 3, huh?

00:16:24.690 --> 00:16:27.220
It's all right. You don't have to take me there.

00:16:27.220 --> 00:16:28.740
What did you want to talk about?

00:16:30.690 --> 00:16:33.060
That's why you came around, right?

00:16:34.470 --> 00:16:37.190
Um, well...

00:16:37.190 --> 00:16:38.770
It's about this.

00:16:41.470 --> 00:16:43.820
It's a key to this Z.

00:16:44.960 --> 00:16:47.990
It's got a key chain with no meaning on it,

00:16:48.700 --> 00:16:51.860
but my brother liked it.

00:16:53.480 --> 00:16:56.990
The day he got in the accident,
he couldn't find these for some reason

00:16:57.570 --> 00:16:59.810
and drove off with the spare key.

00:17:00.200 --> 00:17:02.030
<i>Hello, Eriko-chan?</i>

00:17:02.030 --> 00:17:04.400
<i>Akio crashed on Wangan!</i>

00:17:05.010 --> 00:17:07.230
<i>Meet me at Nakanochou Hospital ER.</i>

00:17:08.040 --> 00:17:09.010
<i>Hurry!</i>

00:17:09.010 --> 00:17:10.440
<i>Hurry up and go!</i>

00:17:10.790 --> 00:17:11.200
<i>Is he ok?!</i>

00:17:11.200 --> 00:17:12.520
<i>Emergency Room Entrance</i>
<i>Is he ok?!</i>

00:17:12.520 --> 00:17:12.800
<i>He was with you, right Tatsuya?!</i>
<i>Emergency Room Entrance</i>

00:17:12.800 --> 00:17:15.510
<i>He was with you, right Tatsuya?!</i>

00:17:15.510 --> 00:17:18.030
<i>Answer me, Tatsuya!</i>

00:17:25.870 --> 00:17:27.190
Thank you.

00:17:27.190 --> 00:17:28.790
This is for you.

00:17:32.530 --> 00:17:34.570
Please take it.

00:17:34.570 --> 00:17:35.770
Bye.

00:17:49.300 --> 00:17:50.820
Hey. You should come!

00:17:53.250 --> 00:17:56.090
Come to Wangan on Wednesday.

00:17:56.590 --> 00:17:59.100
Sit in the other seat and ride with me.

00:17:59.100 --> 00:18:03.590
Race with me against the BlackBird.

00:18:05.440 --> 00:18:12.100
Maybe you'll find the answer to your question.

00:18:18.640 --> 00:18:21.470
Man, it's getting chilly.

00:18:30.040 --> 00:18:31.510
Here he is.

00:18:31.510 --> 00:18:33.020
It's the BlackBird, Akio.

00:18:48.040 --> 00:18:51.220
You're kidding me. He's got a chick with him?

00:18:51.220 --> 00:18:53.010
Nothing wrong with that.

00:18:53.010 --> 00:18:54.320
I'll cut to the chase.

00:18:54.320 --> 00:18:56.020
Start at the coast and head toward Haneda.

00:18:56.020 --> 00:18:57.700
Take the Yokohama-Haneda road.

00:18:57.700 --> 00:18:59.280
The finish line is the Bay Bridge.

00:18:59.280 --> 00:19:00.320
Ok.

00:19:00.800 --> 00:19:03.720
Man, he likes to follow the latest fads.
All the Bay Bridge and stuff.

00:19:03.720 --> 00:19:05.320
Just keep quiet.

00:19:05.320 --> 00:19:07.230
Well then, shall we start?

00:19:10.330 --> 00:19:11.270
C'mon.

00:19:11.270 --> 00:19:13.840
Get in the Z.

00:19:15.830 --> 00:19:19.020
What the hell are you saying, Akio?!

00:19:32.160 --> 00:19:33.910
You can go if you want.

00:19:36.170 --> 00:19:38.680
It's best if you decide who you'll ride with.

00:20:12.730 --> 00:20:15.370
No way, man. You lost them already!

00:20:15.370 --> 00:20:17.260
Get it together, bro!

00:20:17.260 --> 00:20:18.220
Shut your mouth!

00:20:30.450 --> 00:20:31.930
<i>Truck on the right...</i>

00:20:31.930 --> 00:20:33.460
<i>Sedan in the center...</i>

00:20:36.190 --> 00:20:38.030
<i>Should I take the open lane on the left?</i>

00:20:39.240 --> 00:20:40.040
<i>No!</i>

00:20:41.540 --> 00:20:42.840
The right lane is fastest!

00:20:48.060 --> 00:20:49.840
I won't let you get ahead!

00:20:55.800 --> 00:20:58.320
Don't suddenly do anything stupid!

00:20:58.320 --> 00:20:59.290
<i>Not good!</i>

00:20:59.290 --> 00:21:01.300
<i>You're overdoing it, Akio!</i>

00:21:03.410 --> 00:21:04.640
Watch this

00:21:04.640 --> 00:21:06.550
and decide for yourself if the Z really is the devil!

00:21:08.350 --> 00:21:09.580
From the right to the center!

00:21:15.560 --> 00:21:17.090
Stop!

00:21:17.090 --> 00:21:19.580
I've had enough! Both of you, just stop!

00:21:41.770 --> 00:21:43.070
I don't get it!

00:21:43.070 --> 00:21:45.090
I just don't understand!

00:21:45.090 --> 00:21:47.260
I just don't see why you, my brother, and Tatsuya want to do this!

00:21:47.260 --> 00:21:48.850
Watch, and watch closely!

00:21:48.850 --> 00:21:50.210
We haven't made it to the finish line yet.

00:21:50.210 --> 00:21:53.940
See if the Z really is the devil.
Just take a good look at this!

00:21:57.740 --> 00:22:00.750
Man, that BlackBird really is a good machine.

00:22:00.750 --> 00:22:03.470
It runs perfectly under control.

00:22:03.470 --> 00:22:07.290
Who came up with the idea that this Z is the devil?

00:22:16.400 --> 00:22:17.920
It's no good.

00:22:17.920 --> 00:22:19.970
This Z will just betray you.

00:22:23.690 --> 00:22:24.990
Even though...

00:22:25.380 --> 00:22:27.600
Even though my brother took such good care of it...

00:22:27.600 --> 00:22:28.690
You're wrong.

00:22:29.010 --> 00:22:31.690
It's not the car's fault.

00:22:38.840 --> 00:22:40.970
It's the exact same situation as last time,

00:22:40.970 --> 00:22:43.210
but I'm not going to crash again!

00:22:45.780 --> 00:22:47.520
No matter what happened in the past,

00:22:47.520 --> 00:22:49.950
you're my machine now, Z!

00:22:49.950 --> 00:22:51.250
It wasn't you.

00:22:51.760 --> 00:22:53.340
<i>Keep believing.</i>

00:22:53.340 --> 00:22:55.820
<i>The accident wasn't your fault.</i>

00:22:55.820 --> 00:22:58.340
<i>Aren't I right, Z?</i>
